session_*.log
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Frontend session tooling writes these into whatever directory an agent opens, and an
# agent sandbox additionally materialises a placeholder at every path it denies writes to
# — as a device node or as an unwritable empty file, varying within a single session.
# None of it is handbook content, and declaring so here is what keeps it out of the
# freshness and developer gates on every machine. The handbook owns only the skill
# directories, which stay tracked and fully visible.
/.mcp.json
/.claude/*
!/.claude/skills/
/.agents/*
!/.agents/skills/
